# Railway upload exclusions for `railway up`.
#
# THE-60 (2026-08-18): `railway up` uploads a snapshot of this directory. With
# no exclusions that is ~186MB — 175MB of it node_modules — across tens of
# thousands of files, and the upload FAILS with
#   "Repository snapshot operation timed out. This may be due to a large
#    repository size or network issues."
# after ~11 minutes, with no build, empty logs and no instances. The failure
# looks like a build problem but nothing was ever built: the snapshot never
# finished uploading.
#
# Everything excluded here is either reinstalled or regenerated by the build
# command in apps/server/railway.toml:
#   pnpm install --frozen-lockfile ... && pnpm --filter @qiju/server... run build
# No dist/ directory is tracked in git (verified), so excluding them is safe.
#
# Tracked source is ~1.7MB across 148 files, which uploads in seconds.

node_modules/
**/node_modules/

.git/

dist/
**/dist/

# local tooling and test output, never needed to build the server
.turbo/
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.playwright-mcp/
*.log
.DS_Store
